SUMMARY:Maddie's Secret
DTSTART:20260711T183000Z
DTEND:20260711T203500Z
DTSTAMP:20260711T183000Z
UID:gbG3DeuWqE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nUnmissable directorial debut sat
 irizing and skewering content culture from iconic alt-comedian John Early\
 , who plays the titular role\, alongside a troupe of comedians including K
 ate Berlant\, Vanessa Bayer\, and Conner O’Malley.  Join John Early for 
 an introduction and post-film Q&A at both showtimes on Friday\, July 10.Fr
 om July 17 to 19\, all 7:00pm screenings will include a pre-recorded Q&A w
 ith John Early and one of these special guests:July 17 - Amy SedarisJuly 1
 8 - Hannah EinbinderJuly 19 - Sarah Sherman\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema
 /in-theaters/maddies-secret-yr\n\nEstimated start: 11:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
